{% doc %}
  Alt text for campaign art, keyed by campaign handle, copied verbatim from the copy register:
  - chapter: landing chapter art, SEO-045…051 (v1.3.7 HD batch 1; v1.4.1 HD batch 2: SEO-046, SEO-047, SEO-050)
  - chapter-desk: a chapter's laptop-only art where it differs from the phone art: SEO-111 (v1.4.12, Shaadi Shift's
    full-face portrait, >= 1024; the phone sweep keeps SEO-049)
  - lifestyle: accepted lifestyle composites, SEO-079…085 (labelled as illustration)
  - package: packaging boxes, SEO-033…039 wording, used theme-locally per SEO-053 (one alt per box image)

  @param {string} key - Campaign handle.
  @param {string} kind - chapter, chapter-desk, lifestyle or package.
{% enddoc %}
{%- case kind -%}
  {%- when 'chapter' -%}
    {%- case key -%}
